msgstr "### 工作函数（客户端）"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:155
#: 70bed6a3ccbd47e89653ab1b2d62fb9d
msgid ""
"The core worker function for a single file is "
"``file_transfer_client_recv_client_start(message, "
