msgid ""
"Calls ``file_transfer_mode_recv(host, port, client_socket, client_id, "
"new_save_path, file_name, command)``."
msgstr "调用“file_transfer_mode_recv(主机、端口、client_socket、client_id、new_save_path、file_name、command)”。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:223
#: a2f55cc995c14ec1ac34545e458dccb2
msgid ""
"This low-level receive function sets up a listening socket on the "
"allocated port, sends the port number back to the client (as "
"``/server_file_transfer_port <port> <client_id>``), accepts the client's "
"connection, and performs the protocol steps described in :ref:`file-"
"transfer-protocol`. The received file is saved under ``received_files/`` "
"(or a subdirectory if a folder transfer was requested)."
msgstr ""
"这个低级接收函数在分配的端口上设置一个监听套接字，将端口号发送回客户端（如“/server_file_transfer_port <port> "
"<client_id>”），接受客户端的连接，并执行文件传输协议中描述的协议步骤。接收到的文件保存在“received_files/”下（如果请求文件夹传输，则保存在子目录下）。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:233
#: da7e5a1f96b3422bbfd8f056eb28dae3
msgid ""
"After the transfer completes (or fails), the port is released with "
"``pfree()``."
msgstr "传输完成（或失败）后，使用“pfree()”释放端口。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:240
#: e9956de8dffe4d898caed46c0e78c93b
msgid "Server-Initiated Transfer (Server → Client)"
msgstr "服务器发起的传输（服务器 → 客户端）"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:242
#: 5e8dbd4b351d467cb809c3182feac0a2
msgid ""
"When the server administrator types a command in the server console, for "
"example ``/file /path/to/file.txt (127.0.0.1,54321)``, the console input "
"thread (``console_input``) parses the command and calls the appropriate "
"server-side file transfer API."
msgstr ""
"当服务器管理员在服务器控制台中键入命令时，例如“/file /path/to/file.txt "
"(127.0.0.1,54321)”，控制台输入线程（“console_input”）会解析该命令并调用相应的服务器端文件传输 API。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:250
#: 3bec81e76a2c4bf3b37386e180cc4fc1
msgid "The recommended entry points for server-to-client transfers are:"
msgstr "服务器到客户端传输的推荐入口点是："

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:253
#: 585d149b4b3f47f09176b4b61d3baeaa
msgid ""
