#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:287
#: 39d0bdae658241a0a8205977cccd0395
msgid ""
"On the client side, when it receives a command like ``/file "
"/path/to/file.txt (127.0.0.1,54321) 42``, ``handle_server_command`` calls"
" ``file_transfer_client_recv_server_start_thread(client_id, "
"client_socket, command)``. This starts a receiver thread analogous to the"
" server's receiver for client-initiated transfers: it allocates a port, "
"replies with ``/server_file_transfer_port``, and calls "
"``file_transfer_mode_recv`` to receive and save the file."
msgstr ""
"在客户端，当它收到类似“/file /path/to/file.txt (127.0.0.1,54321) "
"42”的命令时，“handle_server_command”会调用“file_transfer_client_recv_server_start_thread(client_id,"
" client_socket, "
"command)”。这将启动一个接收器线程，类似于用于客户端启动的传输的服务器接收器：它分配一个端口，用“/server_file_transfer_port”回复，并调用“file_transfer_mode_recv”来接收和保存文件。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:303
#: 014166967bb14b20a2782598b535575a
msgid "Folder Transfer Mechanism (Detailed)"
msgstr "文件夹传输机制（详细）"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:305
#: 38eff5e62e844c0e94d587ba7132d26c
msgid ""
"Transferring a folder is implemented as a **recursive walk** that sends "
"separate commands for subdirectories and files. The logic is symmetric on"
" both client and server."
msgstr "传输文件夹是通过“递归遍历”来实现的，它为子目录和文件发送单独的命令。客户端和服务器上的逻辑是对称的。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:311
#: 7319cca2fbef48679002d3bf0469d842
msgid "### Creating Directories"
msgstr "### 创建目录"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:313
#: ad592f4510c34ecca1cba340caa2710e
msgid ""
"For a directory that needs to be created on the receiver side, the sender"
" sends a command of the form:"
msgstr "对于需要在接收方创建的目录，发送方发送以下形式的命令："

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:317
#: 114e36ce42e940cc8f0ec8c64c1db031
msgid "``/file_folder <relative_path>``"
msgstr "``/file_folder <相对路径>``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:319
#: a120552b93294a059a34132ab935068a
msgid ""
"The receiver's handler for this command (in either "
"``file_folder_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread`` or "
"``file_folder_transfer_client_recv_server_start_thread``) creates the "
"corresponding directory under the base receive directory "
"(``received_files/`` for the server, the same directory for the client). "
"The relative path uses forward slashes to be platform-independent."
msgstr "该命令的接收器处理程序（在“file_folder_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread”或“file_folder_transfer_client_recv_server_start_thread”中）在基本接收目录下创建相应的目录（对于服务器来说是“received_files/”，对于客户端来说是相同的目录）。相对路径使用正斜杠与平台无关。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:330
#: 2743fec0a2434e2b96ea3c49fecf268c
msgid "### Sending Files Inside a Folder"
msgstr "### 发送文件夹内的文件"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:332
#: fb31b657a05547109dea51165844a632
msgid "For each file, the sender sends a command of the form:"
msgstr "对于每个文件，发送者发送以下形式的命令："

