msgstr ""
"像每个传输家族一样，这两个命令都接受一个可选的后缀`` destination_file_path '' "
"，替换每个接收客户端上的默认保存目录：转发文件位于`<destination><filename>`/`` "
"，转发文件夹将其结构保留在``<destination>/<folder_name>/... ``下。当参数被省略时，目标写入其默认`` "
"file_transfer_dir ``。"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:457
#: 6b31e93335824fe1bfdb83b84f42f08c
msgid "The data path reuses the protocol's own transfer machinery:"
